WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.675
Receptionist (Australian female): Good morning, Westbridge University Residence. How can I help?

00:05.135 --> 00:08.928
Student (British male): Hello. I'm calling to complete my accommodation application.

00:09.448 --> 00:13.014
Receptionist (Australian female): Certainly. First, can I take your family name?

00:13.354 --> 00:16.619
Student (British male): It's Chen. C, H, E, N.

00:17.139 --> 00:19.346
Receptionist (Australian female): Thank you. And when will you arrive?

00:19.666 --> 00:24.986
Student (British male): On the fourteenth of October. I originally wrote the twelfth, but my flight changed.

00:25.406 --> 00:29.542
Receptionist (Australian female): Right, the fourteenth of October. Do you want a shared room?

00:29.862 --> 00:34.280
Student (British male): No, a single room, please. I need somewhere quiet to study.

00:34.700 --> 00:36.563
Receptionist (Australian female): Any dietary requirement?

00:36.863 --> 00:41.683
Student (British male): Yes, vegetarian. I eat dairy products, but no meat or fish.

00:42.243 --> 00:59.579
Receptionist (Australian female): Now, several facilities are included in the weekly fee. Every room has Wi-Fi, and residents can use the bicycle storage without charge. The laundry is available, but each wash costs three pounds. Breakfast is optional, and I'm afraid there is no gym in this building.

01:00.119 --> 01:02.766
Student (British male): That's fine. What documents do you need?

01:03.066 --> 01:14.399
Receptionist (Australian female): Please send a copy of your passport by email. You can show the original at reception when you arrive. The deposit must be paid by bank transfer. We cannot accept cash for that.

01:14.859 --> 01:18.068
Student (British male): I understand. What time can I collect my key?

01:18.368 --> 01:25.585
Receptionist (Australian female): Check-in begins at three p.m. You said your flight lands at two, so arriving around half past four should be comfortable.

01:26.045 --> 01:34.824
Student (British male): Great. I chose Westbridge because it is close to the science building. The city centre residence was newer, but it was much farther from my classes.

01:35.184 --> 01:38.803
Receptionist (Australian female): That makes sense. I'll email your confirmation today.
